WEBVTT

00:00:01.240 --> 00:00:03.610
Will you do it with me?

00:00:17.260 --> 00:00:19.040
What a strange fellow...

00:00:24.180 --> 00:00:26.770
Well then, Kota... I'm heading out now.

00:00:33.770 --> 00:00:36.120
'Morning, Madame Aoi!

00:00:38.260 --> 00:00:41.080
Now, about this Oga Tatsumi 
and the trouble he's caused...

00:00:41.660 --> 00:00:44.460
The second years Abe, Shimokawa, 
and the Sanada Brothers,

00:00:44.460 --> 00:00:47.660
plus the third years Kanzaki and Himekawa...

00:00:47.660 --> 00:00:50.860
It seems he is so violent he 
defeated them all in one hit.

00:00:51.500 --> 00:00:54.430
And for some strange reason, 
always on his back is a...

00:00:59.780 --> 00:01:03.790
It matters not. Anyone who might pose 
a threat to the women of Ishiyama...

00:01:10.520 --> 00:01:12.470
I will bring the iron hammer down upon them!

00:01:13.480 --> 00:01:16.080
Your technique is impressive, as always!

00:01:18.090 --> 00:01:20.490
Just you wait, Oga Tatsumi!

00:01:21.730 --> 00:01:25.050
This is a story of a high school 
juvenile delinquent who,

00:01:25.050 --> 00:01:27.260
through some strange circumstances, 
is raising a baby.

00:01:27.260 --> 00:01:31.040
But this baby is no ordinary baby.

00:01:31.040 --> 00:01:33.020
It is a baby Demon Lord!

00:03:13.960 --> 00:03:18.960
<b>We Met Again</b>

00:03:23.310 --> 00:03:24.890
So? Tasty?

00:03:27.100 --> 00:03:30.360
You've quite gotten the hang 
of it. That's excellent.

00:03:31.000 --> 00:03:35.270
After getting shocked each time he cries 
because he's hungry, heck yeah I got the hang of it!

00:03:36.540 --> 00:03:39.650
And isn't this a woman's job, anyway?

00:03:39.650 --> 00:03:42.930
Oh? Men and women have equal 
rights in the human world.

00:03:43.610 --> 00:03:47.620
I hear that men are now playing 
active roles in child-rearing.

00:03:47.620 --> 00:03:49.620
That's out there! But this is my house!

00:03:49.620 --> 00:03:51.200
Oga-kun!

00:03:53.880 --> 00:03:55.960
Let's go to school togethers!

00:03:55.960 --> 00:03:57.460
What are you, 12?!

00:03:59.320 --> 00:04:03.550
Until now, you have been trying to push 
the master onto someone else, you fiend.

00:04:04.890 --> 00:04:07.500
The master choosing you 
is proof of your strength.

00:04:08.170 --> 00:04:10.100
You should take some pride in that.

00:04:11.140 --> 00:04:13.300
Hurry ups!

00:04:14.050 --> 00:04:14.830
Shuddap!

00:04:21.420 --> 00:04:22.860
What're you on cloud nine for?

00:04:23.120 --> 00:04:26.240
Because the Queen has returned!

00:04:26.860 --> 00:04:27.450
Who?

00:04:28.260 --> 00:04:31.000
The Queen! Ishiyama's Queen!

00:04:31.510 --> 00:04:32.290
Queen?

00:04:39.700 --> 00:04:40.840
Hey, look...

00:04:41.350 --> 00:04:41.970
What is it?

00:04:42.240 --> 00:04:44.290
Whoa! There are girls here!

00:04:53.500 --> 00:04:55.550
Hey, go try talkin' to 'em!

00:04:55.550 --> 00:04:57.170
No-no, you go.

00:04:57.170 --> 00:04:58.960
No need to be shy!

00:04:58.960 --> 00:05:00.650
There's no need for <i>you</i> to be shy either!

00:05:01.120 --> 00:05:02.630
What, you scared?

00:05:03.020 --> 00:05:03.920
Say that again, punk!

00:05:04.250 --> 00:05:05.360
You wanna go, huh?

00:05:11.360 --> 00:05:12.600
Welcome back!

00:05:17.020 --> 00:05:17.660
That's...

00:05:18.680 --> 00:05:21.500
She's back after conquering 
all the Ladies of North Kanto!

00:05:25.170 --> 00:05:26.850
Our Ishiyama's Queen!

00:05:27.170 --> 00:05:28.560
Queen Kunieda!

00:05:33.280 --> 00:05:34.080
Queen Aoi!

00:05:34.460 --> 00:05:37.620
And Nene-san looks even 
more gallant than before!

00:05:37.620 --> 00:05:39.900
Chiaki-san's just as cool as ever!

00:05:43.210 --> 00:05:45.150
Oga, look at this!

00:05:46.780 --> 00:05:49.030
Girls! Girls! Girls! Girls!

00:05:50.150 --> 00:05:52.650
Thanks to Ishiyama's Queen returning...

00:05:52.650 --> 00:05:57.520
It's like late sakura are blooming 
in this decrepit Ishiyama!

00:05:59.910 --> 00:06:00.850
You want some?

00:06:02.410 --> 00:06:05.050
Oga! Even after looking 
at that group of girls,

00:06:05.050 --> 00:06:07.340
you still don't understand 
the gravity of the situation?

00:06:07.340 --> 00:06:11.350
Well, I know there aren't many girls, but 
we're originally an integrated school, right?

00:06:11.350 --> 00:06:13.610
No one actually knew that!

00:06:13.950 --> 00:06:17.050
Most people totally thought 
this was an all-boys school!

00:06:17.350 --> 00:06:18.430
Seriously!

00:06:21.050 --> 00:06:24.170
It was cold... Oh, so very cold...

00:06:24.170 --> 00:06:28.000
My drab-gray colored high school life, 
surrounded by idiotic male delinquents...

00:06:28.820 --> 00:06:30.170
But, now...

00:06:30.610 --> 00:06:32.720
Things are going to be different!

00:06:32.720 --> 00:06:35.580
Say Oga... Is it okay for me to fall in love?

00:06:35.580 --> 00:06:36.250
Ugh...

00:06:37.730 --> 00:06:40.040
Ooh! My babe-sense is tingling!

00:06:40.040 --> 00:06:41.750
Here we go!

00:06:43.380 --> 00:06:44.410
That's...

00:06:44.700 --> 00:06:45.800
Hold it, Furuichi!

00:06:49.570 --> 00:06:51.840
That quite large, solidly built body!

00:06:51.840 --> 00:06:53.300
That firm ass!

00:06:53.300 --> 00:06:54.450
What do you think of her?

00:06:57.900 --> 00:07:00.220
Furuichi-dono! There you are...

00:07:00.220 --> 00:07:03.500
I was so lonely during the day not 
being able to see you, Furuichi-dono,

00:07:04.030 --> 00:07:05.100
so I've come to the school!

00:07:05.300 --> 00:07:07.740
What do you think of my school uniform?

00:07:07.740 --> 00:07:10.660
Anyway, the person at the 
pinnacle of all these girls,

00:07:10.660 --> 00:07:13.420
is Ishiyama's Queen Kunieda!

00:07:14.130 --> 00:07:15.430
Queen, huh?

00:07:15.430 --> 00:07:18.070
So, let's go! Let's check 
her out! Let's go now!

00:07:18.580 --> 00:07:19.890
Don't pull my hair, damn you!

00:07:21.540 --> 00:07:23.130
Furuichi-dono!

00:07:23.540 --> 00:07:25.420
Whoa. What the hell is that?

00:07:25.580 --> 00:07:26.390
Ew...

00:07:26.390 --> 00:07:27.780
Some old guy?

00:07:32.900 --> 00:07:35.290
Making the rounds so quick after your return?

00:07:35.680 --> 00:07:37.190
Get off yer high horse, girly!

00:07:37.660 --> 00:07:39.560
Put on a skirt, would ya?

00:07:39.990 --> 00:07:42.950
These boys are always so annoying...

00:07:45.030 --> 00:07:47.440
Madame Aoi, tell 'im who's boss!

00:07:48.020 --> 00:07:49.450
Don't let them walk all over you!

00:07:49.950 --> 00:07:51.090
Ignore them.

00:07:51.750 --> 00:07:53.450
They don't actually have 
the guts to do anything.

00:07:54.550 --> 00:07:55.570
Now that pisses me off.

00:07:56.130 --> 00:07:57.950
Leave this to me!

00:07:59.050 --> 00:08:00.220
It's Abe, the Killing Machine!

00:08:00.700 --> 00:08:02.160
What're you gonna kill?

00:08:02.160 --> 00:08:05.710
Today's prey is... there!

00:08:05.710 --> 00:08:08.460
Whoops! I accidentally slipped!

00:08:21.520 --> 00:08:25.070
Chiaki, that's enough. 
You're going to kill him.

00:08:25.730 --> 00:08:27.680
Ooh, how scary.

00:08:29.450 --> 00:08:33.650
I had heard that highly pressurized 
water blasts can even cut through metal,

00:08:33.970 --> 00:08:36.240
but actually seeing them in 
action is quite frightful, yes.

00:08:36.730 --> 00:08:38.010
Oh! Good night.

00:08:38.600 --> 00:08:40.050
Are they all like this?

00:08:40.640 --> 00:08:41.890
It's morning, though.

00:08:42.420 --> 00:08:43.730
That's just harsh of you.

00:08:44.120 --> 00:08:46.820
So, have you thought about my deal?

00:08:46.820 --> 00:08:47.850
What do you mean?

00:08:48.690 --> 00:08:53.130
You promised, remember? If I fought 
you and won, you'd go out with me.

00:08:54.260 --> 00:08:57.470
Oh, yeah... I think I did 
promise something like that.

00:08:57.690 --> 00:09:00.450
Good. That's the look I like.

00:09:05.470 --> 00:09:08.750
You wanna do it with her, 
you gotta beat me first!

00:09:10.540 --> 00:09:13.490
Fine, but I'm not going to date you, got it?

00:09:13.490 --> 00:09:16.760
No need to worry about that, you freaky man!

00:09:17.280 --> 00:09:18.620
Nene, quit it!

00:09:20.850 --> 00:09:23.650
Come on. I'll put you out in three seconds.

00:09:24.270 --> 00:09:25.120
Good night!

00:09:26.070 --> 00:09:28.440
Then I'll do you in one!

00:09:37.200 --> 00:09:39.220
I told you to quit it.

00:09:42.950 --> 00:09:45.080
Wait... That's a wooden sword, right?

00:09:46.950 --> 00:09:47.410
And?

00:09:48.980 --> 00:09:51.640
You were saying something 
about, "if you beat me"?

00:09:52.590 --> 00:09:55.200
Uh, right... Maybe another time...

00:09:55.590 --> 00:09:56.240
Good night!

00:09:59.740 --> 00:10:00.650
Whoa...

00:10:00.890 --> 00:10:02.600
How did she do that with a wooden sword?

00:10:03.160 --> 00:10:05.000
Where? Where is she?

00:10:05.000 --> 00:10:07.210
Where's Ishiyama's Queen?

00:10:10.220 --> 00:10:12.340
Someone... Call an ambulance...

00:10:12.620 --> 00:10:14.830
Scary... Was there a fight?

00:10:15.110 --> 00:10:17.010
Hey, I need to feed Baby Beel soon...

00:10:17.010 --> 00:10:20.590
It doesn't look like she's 
here. On to the next!

00:10:20.590 --> 00:10:21.670
But I'm trying to tell you...

00:10:31.900 --> 00:10:36.890
Mirror, mirror in my hand, who is the 
fairest in all the land of Ishiyama?

00:10:39.580 --> 00:10:42.320
Actually, it seems she's 
come back to school now.

00:10:43.660 --> 00:10:46.110
Always breaking the mood, you are.

00:10:47.780 --> 00:10:50.750
Whatever. Who came back to the school?

00:10:51.000 --> 00:10:54.840
Right. Ishiyama's Queen, Kunieda.

00:10:55.080 --> 00:10:56.400
What did you say?!

00:10:58.830 --> 00:10:59.840
Let me ask you one more time...

00:11:00.600 --> 00:11:04.160
Mirror, mirror in my hand, who is the 
fairest in all the land of Ishiyama?

00:11:06.170 --> 00:11:08.470
T-That would be you, Miwa-sama.

00:11:11.110 --> 00:11:12.950
Well, it seems you finally 
went with the mood.

00:11:13.800 --> 00:11:16.390
There isn't room for two 
Queens in this school!

00:11:19.000 --> 00:11:22.900
Listen. I want you to keep tabs 
on this Kunieda Aoi person.

00:11:23.680 --> 00:11:26.950
Report her every little activity!

00:11:41.130 --> 00:11:45.170
If you accept every challenge to a fight 
with you, there won't be any end to it!

00:11:45.510 --> 00:11:45.980
Yes'm.

00:11:46.670 --> 00:11:48.600
We only have one enemy.

00:11:49.360 --> 00:11:49.740
Yes'm.

00:11:50.670 --> 00:11:51.770
Tell me who it is.

00:11:52.270 --> 00:11:53.690
Oga Tatsumi.

00:11:54.560 --> 00:11:55.400
That's right!

00:11:55.950 --> 00:11:57.560
While we were gone,

00:11:57.560 --> 00:12:01.340
there have been 13 incidents at the school 
that sent more than 50 people to the hospital!

00:12:01.940 --> 00:12:05.950
Even though he's a first year, he's already 
taken on the second and even third years!

00:12:06.250 --> 00:12:07.790
That man's like some sort of demon!

00:12:12.940 --> 00:12:16.090
If things keep going like this, 
Ishiyama will be demolished.

00:12:16.420 --> 00:12:16.790
Right.

00:12:17.850 --> 00:12:22.070
I don't care about the boys, but in order to 
protect the girls from his poison claws...

00:12:22.840 --> 00:12:25.440
We have to bring down the 
iron hammer on Oga Tatsumi!

00:12:25.910 --> 00:12:26.460
Right.

00:12:29.030 --> 00:12:32.060
How fearful an opponent 
must this Oga Tatsumi be?

00:12:32.850 --> 00:12:33.970
I will definitely...

00:12:34.960 --> 00:12:38.070
Where? Where's the Queen?

00:12:38.430 --> 00:12:40.660
Damn it, I can't find her!

00:12:41.300 --> 00:12:44.040
You call her Queen, but she's 
just a delinquent, right?

00:12:44.040 --> 00:12:47.200
Oh, no... According to what I 
hear, she's the perfect woman!

00:12:47.570 --> 00:12:51.880
And she protects the girls of 
Ishiyama from the delinquents!

00:12:52.560 --> 00:12:55.270
So you're the first one she'd skewer, right?

00:12:56.040 --> 00:12:59.960
And the rumors are that she's 
stronger than Himekawa or Kanzaki.

00:13:05.770 --> 00:13:06.390
A cold?

00:13:07.150 --> 00:13:08.880
Someone was sayin' stuff about me.

00:13:09.690 --> 00:13:11.740
Anyway... You get the picture, right?

00:13:12.150 --> 00:13:17.150
Yeah. We can't let that Queen get the 
upper hand while she thinks we're gone.

00:13:17.650 --> 00:13:20.780
Thwack her down hard. Gotta 
keep the nails from poppin' up.

00:13:35.830 --> 00:13:37.750
Kanzaki and Himekawa...

00:13:37.910 --> 00:13:39.460
Weren't you two in the hospital?

00:13:40.590 --> 00:13:42.310
Money solved that.

00:13:43.010 --> 00:13:46.260
Anyway, we have something 
to say to this lady here.

00:13:46.260 --> 00:13:47.960
Oh, what?

00:13:48.400 --> 00:13:49.510
H-Hey...

00:13:49.510 --> 00:13:50.770
You tell her.

00:13:51.120 --> 00:13:53.430
Uh? Uh... Uh...

00:13:54.750 --> 00:13:58.650
You get the picture right? 
While we're gone...

00:14:02.000 --> 00:14:04.750
W-While we're gone...

00:14:04.750 --> 00:14:06.980
Good work in conquering North Kanto...

00:14:06.980 --> 00:14:08.970
And... Welcome back!

00:14:11.200 --> 00:14:11.790
What was that?

00:14:12.440 --> 00:14:13.200
Leave them alone.

00:14:13.800 --> 00:14:14.370
Let's go.

00:14:15.820 --> 00:14:20.060
I don't care about those small fry. 
More importantly, where's Oga Tatsumi?

00:14:20.380 --> 00:14:22.040
Queen!

00:14:22.040 --> 00:14:24.250
We need to feed Baby Beel his milk!

00:14:26.050 --> 00:14:26.440
Hey...

00:14:26.870 --> 00:14:27.380
Isn't that...

00:14:27.700 --> 00:14:30.240
Hey! Where are you?

00:14:30.240 --> 00:14:31.120
Let's do it.

00:14:31.120 --> 00:14:33.380
It's time to pay him back, huh?

00:14:38.180 --> 00:14:39.290
Where are you?

00:14:39.290 --> 00:14:40.670
Queen!

00:14:42.710 --> 00:14:44.140
After we heal up.

00:14:44.450 --> 00:14:45.080
Right?

00:14:45.290 --> 00:14:47.790
Yes. Anyway, how about a banana?

00:14:48.550 --> 00:14:49.910
Sure. Thanks.

00:14:50.590 --> 00:14:52.200
Queen!

00:14:52.710 --> 00:14:54.000
Where in the world could he...

00:14:54.470 --> 00:14:56.360
Queen!

00:14:56.360 --> 00:15:00.440
Furichi-dono! Where are you?

00:15:02.130 --> 00:15:05.220
Madame Aoi, nothing is going 
to be settled at this rate.

00:15:04.860 --> 00:15:06.750
Queen!

00:15:05.220 --> 00:15:06.000
Let us...

00:15:09.450 --> 00:15:11.310
Give me a break here, okay?

00:15:11.310 --> 00:15:14.350
What are you talking about, Oga? 
You want to meet the Queen, right?

00:15:15.580 --> 00:15:16.600
That's...

00:15:16.880 --> 00:15:17.260
He's coming.

00:15:17.890 --> 00:15:18.750
He came to us?

00:15:19.600 --> 00:15:22.350
You want to meet the Queen?

00:15:23.300 --> 00:15:24.210
I see.

00:15:24.680 --> 00:15:27.920
After Kanzaki and Himekawa, I'm next, huh?

00:15:29.020 --> 00:15:31.690
You're underestimating me, Oga Tatsumi!

00:15:32.150 --> 00:15:33.090
Prepare yourself!

00:15:33.090 --> 00:15:35.060
Your evil ways end now!

00:15:49.020 --> 00:15:51.700
Could this be Kunieda Aoi?

00:15:56.950 --> 00:15:58.900
Ooh, nice! Navel exposure!

00:16:01.920 --> 00:16:04.100
Y-You're Oga Tatsumi?

00:16:04.700 --> 00:16:05.700
Yes. And...?

00:16:07.150 --> 00:16:10.440
Um... I've totally seen him around before.

00:16:14.400 --> 00:16:16.030
Look, over here!

00:16:16.030 --> 00:16:16.830
Whoa!

00:16:16.830 --> 00:16:20.620
The Rampaging Ogre and Queen Kunieda 
are going at it right off the bat!

00:16:20.620 --> 00:16:21.760
Seriously?

00:16:22.290 --> 00:16:24.000
Which one of 'em will win?

00:16:25.220 --> 00:16:28.940
What'll I do? Thankfully, he 
doesn't seem to have realized yet.

00:16:29.650 --> 00:16:32.170
Anyway, I'll just pretend like 
I've never met him before...

00:16:38.560 --> 00:16:40.000
Could it be... He noticed?

00:16:42.410 --> 00:16:44.100
Uh... He definitely knows!

00:16:44.430 --> 00:16:46.100
That kid has noticed something!

00:16:49.650 --> 00:16:50.280
My imagination?

00:16:51.690 --> 00:16:53.200
I knew it, he noticed!

00:16:54.580 --> 00:16:55.280
No?

00:16:55.280 --> 00:16:57.520
He totally noticed!

00:16:58.650 --> 00:16:59.330
No?

00:17:00.260 --> 00:17:01.580
Which one is it?

00:17:01.810 --> 00:17:03.210
Oga!

00:17:03.700 --> 00:17:04.750
What is it now?!

00:17:05.160 --> 00:17:06.000
What?

00:17:06.590 --> 00:17:10.200
Look! The two behind her are 
serious keepers as well!

00:17:10.590 --> 00:17:11.890
Can I go home now?

00:17:12.280 --> 00:17:14.680
Come on, man! Why you gotta be like this?

00:17:14.680 --> 00:17:17.150
The Queen called your name herself!

00:17:17.650 --> 00:17:20.070
Well, it sounded like she's picking a fight.

00:17:21.160 --> 00:17:24.080
But, he's in high school.

00:17:24.490 --> 00:17:26.950
And wait, is the kid from some relationship?

00:17:27.580 --> 00:17:29.820
He takes care of him, even 
taking him to school....

00:17:30.220 --> 00:17:32.570
Is he really such a bad person?

00:17:33.570 --> 00:17:34.960
Hey-hey! What're you doing?

00:17:35.370 --> 00:17:36.500
Arranged marriage?

00:17:36.500 --> 00:17:38.190
You ain't scared, right?

00:17:38.190 --> 00:17:40.350
You're called the Queen, but 
in the end you're just a woman!

00:17:40.350 --> 00:17:42.090
Is that all you got, Kunieda?

00:17:42.800 --> 00:17:43.750
Madame Aoi?

00:17:52.180 --> 00:17:53.690
Put down the baby.

00:17:56.550 --> 00:17:58.930
You can't fight seriously that way, right?

00:17:59.720 --> 00:18:02.430
Whoa, hold it... She cut 
that with a wooden sword?

00:18:06.050 --> 00:18:06.710
Baby Beel?

00:18:10.100 --> 00:18:13.080
And isn't this a woman's job, anyway?

00:18:13.640 --> 00:18:16.300
The master choosing you 
is proof of your strength.

00:18:21.350 --> 00:18:22.240
Good.

00:18:22.430 --> 00:18:22.880
Oga?

00:18:23.730 --> 00:18:26.200
Come at me. I'll fight you like this.

00:18:26.640 --> 00:18:27.610
H-Hey!

00:18:28.860 --> 00:18:34.300
Oga Tatsumi... Using a baby as a shield. 
You really are a total bastard.

00:18:35.690 --> 00:18:36.540
Or is it...

00:18:38.380 --> 00:18:39.560
...that you are...

00:18:40.530 --> 00:18:41.670
...underestimating me, perhaps?

00:18:44.290 --> 00:18:45.080
He dodged!

00:18:46.160 --> 00:18:47.850
Even at this distance?

00:18:51.320 --> 00:18:52.340
Not bad.

00:18:52.900 --> 00:18:54.110
But, this will end it.

00:18:55.570 --> 00:18:57.610
Yes... Here it comes.

00:18:58.850 --> 00:19:01.430
Shingetsu sword school, second style.

00:19:01.430 --> 00:19:02.450
Its name is...

00:19:03.120 --> 00:19:04.240
Countless Petals...

00:19:05.190 --> 00:19:06.160
Scattering Sakura Blossoms!

00:19:09.270 --> 00:19:09.960
Oga!

00:19:18.680 --> 00:19:19.490
You've got to be kidding me...

00:19:19.960 --> 00:19:22.140
Scary! What are you, Hilda?

00:19:23.050 --> 00:19:24.470
He dodged them all!

00:19:25.820 --> 00:19:28.020
Both of them are amazing...

00:19:28.670 --> 00:19:31.000
Now look what you did to 
the school building...

00:19:31.250 --> 00:19:33.020
Uh, you're not one to talk.

00:19:35.280 --> 00:19:37.880
Oh, right! You like her, huh?

00:19:38.450 --> 00:19:40.930
Okay, righty then.

00:19:41.390 --> 00:19:43.670
She's a woman, and she's strong too!

00:19:45.520 --> 00:19:46.420
Hold up a sec...

00:19:49.740 --> 00:19:50.650
What power!

00:19:51.430 --> 00:19:52.420
He's going to kill me!

00:19:52.420 --> 00:19:53.250
Madame!

00:19:54.610 --> 00:19:55.670
If you're going to do it, get it over with...

00:19:56.680 --> 00:19:57.360
Take this...

00:20:01.680 --> 00:20:03.310
...baby and be its mother, please?

00:20:11.580 --> 00:20:11.970
Huh?

00:20:15.710 --> 00:20:18.190
W-W-W-W-What are you saying?

00:20:18.190 --> 00:20:19.410
You're kidding, right?

00:20:19.770 --> 00:20:21.480
Y-You big fat idiot!

00:20:21.480 --> 00:20:23.220
I don't even wanna fight anymore!

00:20:23.220 --> 00:20:25.050
I'll let you off for now.

00:20:25.050 --> 00:20:27.150
You stupid stupid-face, Oga!

00:20:28.160 --> 00:20:29.330
See you later, 'kay?

00:20:29.840 --> 00:20:31.050
Ah... Oy!

00:20:32.980 --> 00:20:34.120
A... oi...?

00:20:36.130 --> 00:20:36.850
Aoi?

00:20:37.200 --> 00:20:39.390
Don't just call me by 
my first name like that!

00:20:39.840 --> 00:20:41.900
You stupid jerk! You stupid, 
stupid, stupid jerk!

00:20:41.900 --> 00:20:46.100
Madame, wait! Please wait, Madame Aoi!

00:20:47.290 --> 00:20:48.240
What was that?

00:20:49.620 --> 00:20:52.220
I was searching for you, Furuichi-dono!

00:20:52.220 --> 00:20:53.600
When did you...

00:20:55.400 --> 00:20:57.270
Stay off of me!

00:21:07.000 --> 00:21:10.520
That guy's the worst... 
Using such cheap tactics.

00:21:10.910 --> 00:21:13.470
It's so obvious he was 
just trying to get to you.

00:21:14.200 --> 00:21:15.010
Isn't that right, Chiaki?

00:21:16.960 --> 00:21:20.940
Madame Aoi... Please, don't fall 
for such dirty tricks, okay?

00:21:24.200 --> 00:21:24.900
Madame?

00:21:26.100 --> 00:21:29.660
I wonder if he's divorced?

00:21:34.770 --> 00:21:39.440
M-Madame Aoi!?

00:23:16.250 --> 00:23:20.850
I see... So Kunieda Aoi has 
such a crucial weak-point...

00:23:22.230 --> 00:23:24.710
Then it's finally our turn, yes?

00:23:28.130 --> 00:23:29.080
I'm counting on you.

00:23:29.460 --> 00:23:29.880
Yes.

00:23:30.270 --> 00:23:33.650
We will definitely take down 
Ishiyama's Queen, Kunieda...

00:23:33.650 --> 00:23:35.470
Who did you call the Queen?

00:23:37.690 --> 00:23:40.330
Next time, read the mood, okay?

00:24:00.770 --> 00:24:03.890
Damn it all! Why is that 
bastard Oga so popular?

00:24:03.890 --> 00:24:07.200
He lives under the same roof as Hilda-san, 
and now he's even being crushed on by the Queen!

00:24:07.200 --> 00:24:09.660
W-When did I have a crush, huh?

00:24:10.260 --> 00:24:13.570
Anyway, it seems like a bunch of people who 
don't read the mood have started something.

00:24:14.310 --> 00:24:15.450
I feel a storm coming...

00:24:16.680 --> 00:24:19.640
On the next Beelzebub: Love is a Hurricane!

00:24:20.500 --> 00:24:21.850
Anyway, are you sure this is gonna be okay?

00:24:22.360 --> 00:24:24.710
This is seeming less and less like 
an academy just full of delinquents.

00:24:25.180 --> 00:24:27.510
W-We aren't all bad apples!
